# Creating an Enabling Environment for the Sponsored Research in the Case of Institute of Electrical Engineering and Information Technology

**Authors:** M. Zagirnyak, A. Gladyr, V. Nozhenko

## Abstract
The paper presents the results of participating in the IREX University Administration Support Program. An implementation plan for the "Establishing Development Program for Sponsored Research at Kremenchuk Mykhailo Ostrohradskyi National University" based on SWOT analysis is proposed. The expected outputs and outcomes of the project were analyzed. To understand the value of all participants involved in the project implementation plan, an analysis of stakeholders (internal departments of the university) was carried out. The work plan of the step-by-step execution of the project using the Gantt chart is presented. The new approach to the providing support of sponsored research was suggested. The first results of the project implementation for academic staff of the Institute of electrical engineering and information technology of the Kremenchuk Mykhailo Ostrohradskyi National University are shown.

